[ NETWORK ]

  - NetworkManager is enabled by default. Wi-Fi, Ethernet, and DNS will
    be configured and connected automatically immediately after boot.

[ INSTALL ]

  - To install ArchangelOS simply run 'archangelos-install' and follow the
    instructions.

[ EXPLOITS ]

  - A collection of exploits can be found in /usr/share/exploits. To update the
    archive use 'sploitctl'.

[ MISC ]

  - A ChangeLog file of the ISO can be found in /root.
  - Remember: HACK THE PLANET, D00R THE PLANET, RULE THE PLANET!
